<title>USA: Transatlantic Holdings Inc raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Transatlantic Holdings Inc raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.10		    $0.135</p>
<p> Pay		   Sept 19</p>
<p> Record		 Sept 5</p>
<p>Note: The dividend represents an 11.1 percent increase in the dividend after the company's planned three-for-two stock split to take place in July.</p>
</text>
